*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Open-source driver for the Polono PL420 thermal label printer.
*% Not made, endorsed or supported by Polono. MIT licence, see LICENSE.
*% Generated by ppd/make_beeprt_ppds.py: edit that, not this file.
*% Option keywords and size names match Polono's own PPD on purpose, so
*% printers switched over from Polono's driver keep their saved settings.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "PL420OPN.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Polono"
*Product: "(PL420)"
*Product: "(Label Printer)"
*ModelName: "Polono PL420"
*ShortNickName: "Polono PL420 (open-source)"
*NickName: "Polono PL420 (open-source driver)"
*% The USB device ID is a best guess: it has not been seen on a real printer.
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Label Printer;MDL:PL420;CMD:TSPL;"
*PolonoProfile: "PL420"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 1.5
*% macOS makes the copies: the printer gets each label as its own page.
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 100 rastertotspl"

*% 4.08 in (104 mm) maximum width, 78.75 in maximum length.
*MaxMediaWidth: "294"
*MaxMediaHeight: "5670"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 36 294
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 36 5670
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0
*RequiresPageRegion All: True

*OpenGroup: General/General

*OpenUI *PageSize/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w283h425
*PageSize w283h425/100 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[283 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w72h144/1 x 2 in: "<</PageSize[72 144]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w144h288/2 x 4 in: "<</PageSize[144 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w162h90/2.25 x 1.25 in: "<</PageSize[162 90]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w162h288/2.25 x 4 in: "<</PageSize[162 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w216h144/3 x 2 in: "<</PageSize[216 144]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w288h288/4 x 4 in: "<</PageSize[288 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w288h432/4 x 6 in: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w141h85/50 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[141 85]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w283h510/100 x 180 mm: "<</PageSize[283 510]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w283h566/100 x 200 mm: "<</PageSize[283 566]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w212h317/75 x 112 mm: "<</PageSize[212 317]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w210h510/74 x 180 mm: "<</PageSize[210 510]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w215h300/76 x 106 mm: "<</PageSize[215 300]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w51h164/18 x 58 mm: "<</PageSize[51 164]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w212h280/75 x 99 mm: "<</PageSize[212 280]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w139h141/49 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[139 141]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w227h227/80 x 80 mm: "<</PageSize[227 227]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: w283h425
*PageRegion w283h425/100 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[283 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w72h144/1 x 2 in: "<</PageSize[72 144]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w144h288/2 x 4 in: "<</PageSize[144 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
