*PageRegion w51h164/18 x 58 mm: "<</PageSize[51 164]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w212h280/75 x 99 mm: "<</PageSize[212 280]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
